# Deny by default: this repo holds the documentation site and the public API source only.
# The Gears mod implementation, UnitTests, build output and the wiki clone stay untracked.
#
# `!*/` is required: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# directories have to stay walkable for the whitelist entries below to match.
*
!*/

# --- documentation site ---
!/.gitignore
!/.github/**
!/docs-site/**

# --- public API surface, so the reference's "Source" links resolve ---
!/GearsAPI/Source/**
!/GearsAPI/Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs
!/GearsAPI/GearsAPI.csproj
!/Directory.Build.props
!/CHANGELOG.md

# --- never track, even under the allowances above (last match wins) ---
/docs-site/node_modules/
/docs-site/.next/
/docs-site/out/
/docs-site/.source/
.gen/
.vs/
packages/
Release/
TestResults/
# The GitHub wiki clone. It has its own .git and is no longer the source of truth.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
*.user
*.suo
